      contract forbids sounds/text leaving the device). The OCR-confidence
      concern resolved by doctrine: recognized text carries no detector
      confidence, so its quote is pinned at the medium hedge regardless.
      Covered by `SoundTextSceneFusionTests` (12 tests).

